/target
shots/

# Claude Code's own local, session-specific state — machine/session
# metadata (PIDs, timestamps, local permission grants) that must never be
# shared between contributors. `.claude/skills/` is real project tooling
# (see README.md) and stays tracked; only these local-state files are
# ignored.
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# A Roblox Open Cloud API key must never be committed — see README.md for
# where it actually belongs (an env var, or one of these files, outside the
# repo). Ignored here only as a safety net in case one ends up in the tree
# by habit or mistake.
api_key
roblox.key
*.key
.env
.env.*
